#: src/macros/macro_rules/techniques/tt-bundling.md:45
msgid ""
"The signature of the recursive arm does not change regardless of how complex "
"the bundled parameters may become."
msgstr ""

#: src/macros/macro_rules/techniques/tt-bundling.md:51
msgid ""
"In the code example, `(present: fail, absent: pass)` represents the bundle, "
"which is matched recursively as a single `$bundle:tt` and passed downstream."
msgstr ""

